Fixed false positives ``undefined-variable``, ``possibly-used-before-assignment`` and
``used-before-assignment`` for a global assigned under ``if "name" not in globals():``.

A name assigned in only one ``if`` branch is now reported as
``possibly-used-before-assignment`` when it is used in an augmented assignment
(``x += 1``) or assigned again later, instead of ``undefined-variable`` or
``used-before-assignment``.

Closes #9633
